  "description": {
    "en": "Babolat RPM Blast 1.25 + Touch VS 1.30 is a premium hybrid string set combining the spin, control and durability of RPM Blast co-polyester with the exceptional feel, elasticity, comfort and tension stability of Touch VS natural gut. Babolat recommends RPM Blast in the mains and Touch VS in the crosses for maximum spin and control, while reversing the setup provides additional power, comfort and feel.",

    "zh": "Babolat RPM Blast 1.25 + Touch VS 1.30 是一套高端混合穿线组合，将 RPM Blast 共聚酯线的旋转、控制与耐久性，与 Touch VS 天然肠线顶级的手感、弹性、舒适性及保磅性能结合。Babolat 建议将 RPM Blast 放在竖线、Touch VS 放在横线，以获得更强旋转和控制；如果将 Touch VS 放在竖线、RPM Blast 放在横线，则会获得更多力量、舒适性与击球反馈。"
  },

